  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "French Soldier",
  "en": "Pucelle, step forward.",
  "fr": "Pucelle, veuillez approcher.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Duke of Lorraine",
  "fr": "&Duc de Lorraine",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Our savior...",
  "fr": "Notre sauveur...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Here she is, come clad in a \nholy armlet.",
  "fr": "Ainsi c'est elle, vêtue du saint\nbracelet.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Let me see it.",
  "fr": "Montrez-le-moi.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "...Your Grace.",
  "fr": "... Votre Grâce.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "...It's real.",
  "fr": "... Il est authentique.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Yours is a legendary armlet \nreputed to have saved the world.",
  "fr": "Vous possédez un des bracelets\nlégendaires,\frenommés pour avoir sauvé le\nmonde.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "It represents an oath,\fthat France's future never go \nundefended.",
  "fr": "Il représente un serment, que\nl'avenir de la France\fsoit à jamais protégé.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "This armlet chose you, Jeanne.",
  "fr": "Ce bracelet vous a choisie, Jeanne.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Then I am to save France?",
  "fr": "Alors je dois sauver la France ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "To be frank, I called you here \nout of hope...",
  "fr": "Pour être franc, je vous ai amenée\nici dans l'espoir...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "that you might use the armlet's \npower to chase the sickness \nfrom my body.",
  "fr": "que vous pourriez utiliser le\npouvoir du bracelet pour chasser\fla maladie qui me ronge.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Your Grace, that's\\u2014",
  "fr": "Votre Grâce, c'est...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Impossible. I know.",
  "fr": "Impossible. Je sais.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "A few extra years tacked on to \none decrepit old man's life...",
  "fr": "Quelques années supplémentaires\najoutées à la vie d'un vieil homme\fdécrépi...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "would hardly change the course \nof French history.",
  "fr": "changeraient à peine le cours de\nl'histoire de France.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Gilles, that man who was here \nbefore, told me as much.",
  "fr": "Gilles, cet homme qui était là tout\nà l'heure, me l'a bien dit.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "He said that?",
  "fr": "Il vous l'a dit ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "My time is passed;\fnow that I've looked upon you, \nI find I can accept that.",
  "fr": "Mon heure est venue,\fmaintenant que je vous ai\nrencontrée,\fje pense que je peux l'accepter.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "But just once before I die, \nI want to see France at peace.",
  "fr": "Mais juste une fois avant de\nmourir,\fje veux voir la France en paix.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "I want to drift off, \nconscience clear, \nto the sound of birds...",
  "fr": "Je veux partir, la conscience\ntranquille,\fsous le chant des oiseaux...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Bedford, Jeanne",
  "en": "Your Grace...",
  "fr": "Votre Grâce...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses, Duke of Lorraine, Roger",
  "en": "Jeanne.",
  "fr": "Jeanne.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Save France. Do it for me.",
  "fr": "Sauvez la France.\nFaites-le pour moi.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "And do it for all the people \nof France.",
  "fr": "Et faites-le pour tout le peuple de\nFrance.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Goad the dauphin out of that \ncastle cocoon of his in Chinon,",
  "fr": "Encouragez le dauphin à sortir de\nson palais doré de Chinon.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "and reclaim the lands of France \nfrom the clutches of the English.",
  "fr": "Et reprenez les terres de France\ndes griffes des Anglais.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "...You needn't even ask.",
  "fr": "... Vous n'avez même pas besoin de\nle demander.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "...SAVE FRANCE...",
  "fr": "... SAUVE LA FRANCE...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "...Is something the matter?",
  "fr": "... Quelque chose vous tracasse ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "No...nothing.",
  "fr": "Non... rien.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "You'll do as I ask, won't you, \nJeanne?",
  "fr": "Vous ferez ce que je demande,\nn'est-ce pas, Jeanne ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Ahh...!",
  "fr": "Ahh... !",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Just a dream...",
  "fr": "C'était qu'un rêve...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "Zzzzzz...\nCoa-wa-wa-wa-wah...",
  "fr": "Zzzzzz... Coa-wa-wa-wa-wah...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "...What are you doing up, Roger?",
  "fr": "... Que fais-tu debout, Roger ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Are you all right? I heard you \ncry out.",
  "fr": "Tu vas bien ? Je t'ai entendu crier.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "I had a dream. An awful one...",
  "fr": "J'ai fait un rêve. Affreux...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Jeanne...what about you?\nAre you all right?",
  "fr": "Jeanne... et toi ? Tu vas bien ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "You look terrible. Like you \nhaven't slept for days.",
  "fr": "Tu sembles éprouvée. Comme si tu\nn'avais pas dormi depuis des jours.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "...I haven't. How could I sleep? \nThere's so much on my mind.",
  "fr": "... En effet.\nComment pourrais-je ?\fTout se bouscule dans ma tête.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Listen, Jeanne...",
  "fr": "Écoute, Jeanne...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "Why don't we go home?\nI know even Liane\\u2014",
  "fr": "Pourquoi ne pas rentrer chez\nnous ? Je sais que même Liane...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "It's Gilles. Sorry to disturb \nyou at this ungodly hour.",
  "fr": "C'est Gilles.\fDésolé de vous déranger à cette\nheure inopportune.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "I'll be departing soon for Chinon.",
  "fr": "Je vais bientôt partir pour Chinon.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "Are you coming, Jeanne?",
  "fr": "Venez-vous, Jeanne ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne, Roger, Gilles",
  "en": "...What?",
  "fr": "... Quoi ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "Surely the duke told you?",
  "fr": "Le Duc vous l'a sûrement\ndemandé.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "...Don't you plan to meet with \nthe dauphin?",
  "fr": "... Ne projetez-vous pas de\nrencontrer le dauphin ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I... I just...",
  "fr": "C'est... c'est que...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I'm so angry at the English.",
  "fr": "Je suis si en colère contre les\nAnglais.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "All I want is to protect everyone.",
  "fr": "Tout ce que je veux c'est protéger\ntout le monde.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I can't think of anything else...",
  "fr": "Je ne peux penser à rien d'autre...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "let alone dream of saving France.",
  "fr": "Sans parler de mon rêve de sauver\nla France.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "So long as you wear that armlet, \nyou have a duty\\u2014",
  "fr": "Tant que vous portez ce bracelet,\nvous avez un devoir...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "the same duty as the heroes of \nold.",
  "fr": "Le même devoir que les héros\nanciens.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "France is counting on you.",
  "fr": "La France compte sur vous.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "Besides, saving France MEANS \nprotecting everyone.",
  "fr": "De même, sauver la France VEUT\nDIRE protéger tout le monde.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I can't do it... Not me.",
  "fr": "Je ne peux pas le faire... Pas moi.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I don't even know how to use \nthe armlet right.",
  "fr": "Je ne sais même pas comment\nutiliser ce bracelet à bon escient.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "I couldn't protect my village \nor the townsmen or anything!",
  "fr": "Je n'ai pas pu protéger mon village,\nni les villageois,\fni quoi que ce soit !",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "...But you can save France.",
  "fr": "... Mais vous pouvez sauver la\nFrance.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "Somehow I just know it.",
  "fr": "Je le sais c'est tout.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "And you did protect something.\nYou saved my life.",
  "fr": "Et vous avez protégé quelque\nchose. Vous m'avez sauvé.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "I'll be waiting in Chinon.",
  "fr": "J'attendrai à Chinon.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "I, at least, am ready to lay \ndown my life for Mother France.",
  "fr": "Moi, au moins, je suis prêt à donner\nma vie pour la France, ma patrie.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "I'll go wherever you go.\nNo matter what you decide...",
  "fr": "J'irai partout où tu iras.\nPeu importe ce que tu décides...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Roger",
  "en": "I'll protect you, I swear it.",
  "fr": "Je te protégerai, je le promets.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne, Liane, unité#31",
  "en": "Roger...",
  "fr": "Roger...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "Jeanne! I'm sorry...",
  "fr": "Jeanne ! Je suis désolée...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne, Roger",
  "en": "Liane?",
  "fr": "Liane ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "I won't cry or complain anymore.\fI'll stick with the two of you as \nlong as it takes!",
  "fr": "Je ne pleurerai ou ne me plaindrai\nplus dorénavant.\fJe vous suivrai tous les deux aussi\nlongtemps que nécessaire !",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Liane... I-I'm sorry.",
  "fr": "Liane... Je-je suis désolée.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "The road to Chinon is long \nand severe.",
  "fr": "La route pour Chinon est longue\net dangereuse.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "In time of danger, I trust these \ntwo will serve you well.",
  "fr": "En cas de danger, je gage que ces\ndeux-là vous seront utiles.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "Go on, introduce yourselves.",
  "fr": "Allez, présentez-vous.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Colet",
  "en": "Salut.",
  "fr": "Salut.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Marcel",
  "en": "Nice to meetcha!",
  "fr": "Content d'vous rencontrer !",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "You've made a difficult choice,\nJeanne...",
  "fr": "Vous avez fait un choix difficile,\nJeanne...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1041BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Duke of Lorraine",
  "en": "and the right one. \nGod be with you.",
  "fr": "Mais le bon choix.\nQue Dieu soit avec vous.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
